{
"id": "4c0f6968cd5a4db1a713445b66e2bd80",
"title": "Hexa Honey Sort",
"iframe": "https://html5.gamedistribution.com/4c0f6968cd5a4db1a713445b66e2bd80/",
"description": "Match and sort hexagonal tiles by color and pattern to clear the board in this puzzle game. Players engage with a unique honeycomb grid mechanic, rotating and positioning pieces strategically to complete increasingly complex levels. The challenge escalates as spaces fill and arranging hexagons into cohesive groups becomes key to progressing through consecutive puzzles.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Hexagonal tile matching system  \n• Strategic rotation and placement controls  \n• Level progression with growing difficulty  \n• Time-limited challenge mode  \n• Honeycomb grid spatial logic"
},
{
"id": "4288c9404c5c4b87881b2365d710c099",
"title": "Cozy Sort: Theme Collect",
"iframe": "https://html5.gamedistribution.com/4288c9404c5c4b87881b2365d710c099/",
"description": "Arrange colorful tiles by matching patterns and colors in a relaxing puzzle environment. Players sort themed collections through a progressive series of levels that test pattern recognition and speed. Each stage introduces new tile categories to organize, adding variety to the sorting mechanic and encouraging quick decision-making.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Pattern matching tile puzzles  \n• Click and drag sorting controls  \n• Increasing difficulty levels  \n• Timer-based challenge mode  \n• Themed visual collections"
},
